<<<
harquebus, arquebus. The OED gives precedence to the h- form. The word is the same as hackbut (=hook-gun), corrupted in passing through Italian by confusion with Latin arcus bow.
===
**harquebus, arquebus.** The OED gives precedence to the *h-* form. The word is the same as *hackbut* (=hook-gun), corrupted in passing through Italian by confusion with Latin *arcus* bow.
>>>

